{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2023-01-06 16:00:00', 'title': 'AMGEN AND BIOLABS LA AT THE LUNDQUIST INSTITUTE ANNOUNCE NAMMI THERAPEUTICS TO RECEIVE THE THIRD AMGEN GOLDEN TICKET', 'text': 'BIOTHERAPEUTICS COMPANY TO RECEIVE LAB SPACE, MENTORING AND OTHER BENEFITS THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF. , JAN. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) AND BIOLABS LA AT THE LUNDQUIST INSTITUTE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT NAMMI THERAPEUTICS HAS BEEN AWARDED THE THIRD AMGEN GOLDEN TICKET IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA.'}